1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,554
Rosa: Engine off. Nobody make a sound.

2
00:00:02,874 --> 00:00:07,268
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus.
Part two of ten: the tunnel.

3
00:00:07,588 --> 00:00:11,112
Rosa: Eight hundred meters. All downhill.
We coast.

4
00:00:11,432 --> 00:00:16,521
Priya: In a tunnel, every sound echoes. So
whisper, like it's a library.

5
00:00:21,941 --> 00:00:23,041
Dante: Somebody shut him up!

6
00:00:23,161 --> 00:00:24,984
Priya: He's asleep. Not infected.

7
00:00:25,304 --> 00:00:27,113
Marcus: Sir? Sir. Sir!

8
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:29,090
Walt: Five more minutes, Margaret.

9
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:33,155
Amara: Shh, shh, shh. Please, baby. Shh.

10
00:00:33,475 --> 00:00:34,942
Vic: Chat. Not now!

11
00:00:35,062 --> 00:00:35,822
Lena: I'll hold it.

12
00:00:36,142 --> 00:00:37,299
Teddy: Gary says that one has a hat.

13
00:00:37,419 --> 00:00:39,281
Rosa: Gary. Quiet.

14
00:00:39,601 --> 00:00:42,751
Dante: Don't panic. I have a tactical
flashlight.

15
00:00:42,871 --> 00:00:44,558
Priya: Light is a loudspeaker!

16
00:00:44,878 --> 00:00:48,158
BUS-E: Attention passengers! We are now
entering the Ridgeway Tunnel!

17
00:00:48,478 --> 00:00:49,011
Marcus: BUS-E!

18
00:00:49,131 --> 00:00:49,987
Priya: BUS-E!

19
00:00:50,107 --> 00:00:50,879
Rosa: BUS-E.

20
00:00:51,199 --> 00:00:53,204
BUS-E (whispering): Whisper mode
activated.

21
00:00:53,524 --> 00:00:56,249
Priya: There. The exit. We made it.

22
00:00:56,569 --> 00:00:57,728
Rosa: ...

23
00:00:57,848 --> 00:00:58,298
Rosa: No.

24
00:00:58,618 --> 00:00:59,927
Priya: How much fuel do we have?

25
00:01:00,047 --> 00:01:00,840
Rosa: Not enough.

26
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:08,660
BUS-E: Part two of ten, The Last Bus. Next stop: the
last drop. Follow for part three. Fuel level: please don't ask.

